# Where a play-test round files what it found: mygame-playtest-<date>.md is the
# report and mygame-playtest-ledger.md is every finding ever refuted, so the next
# round does not re-find them. A design doc at mygame.md is optional and the round
# says so out loud when there is none — write one when you have something true to
# put in it, not before.
